<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>MARIA LANKOWITZ, Austria, Aug 1 (Retuer) - Quarter-final results at  the $107,000 women's Styria Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix  number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Meike Babel (Germany) beat Gala Leon-Garcia (Spain) 6-3 6-1 6-Henrieta  Nagyova (Slovakia) beat 4-Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 0-6 6-4 6-2   </p>
<p>Maria Sanchez-Lorenzo (Spain) beat 1-Barbara Paulus (Austria) -</p>
<p>Paulus retired injured.</p>
<p>5-Barbara Schett (Austria) beat 3-Judith Wiesner (Austria) 3-6</p>
<p>7-5 6-0</p>
</text>
